export anchor BanknoteEngravingStyle:
    number: 373
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Banknote engraving
    idea: The overview printed as a dark green banknote, with the everyday balance as its denomination, an engraved oval frame holding a fern emblem, a guilloche rosette ringed by the savings goal, fine line etched meters and double rules throughout.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deepGreen: #08150f, the page and the style sheet
        note: #0f2419, the banknote, mini notes, panels and fields
        noteTwo: #163223, inside the oval frame
        line: #2f5a43, double frames, rules, guilloche back lines and dotted dividers
        engraving: #7fbf98, etched meter lines, the emblem, medallions, remaining status and money in
        ink: #e4f0e1, text and figures
        muted: #a9c6b0, labels, italics and dates
        ochre: #d9bd7c, denomination corners, headings, the goal ring, the primary button and focus
        rust: #f0a58c, the serial line, the owed balance and the exceeded meter and status
        onOchre: #1d1606, text on the ochre button
    type:
        Baskerville, Baskerville Old Face, Hoefler Text, Libre Baskerville,
        Garamond, Times New Roman. Base 16px at 1.55. The denomination is 64px
        at 400 with a 32px ochre euro sign. The note title is 20px caps tracked
        .2em in ochre, section heads 15px caps tracked .3em in ochre with a
        double rule running to the right, body 16px and status 14px italic. The
        serial line is 13px ui-monospace tracked .2em in rust.
    layout:
        A 1180px page. The header has Brightwork Money in widely tracked caps,
        an italic line for Mara Okafor, October, in euros, and caps nav with
        Overview underlined in ochre. The main element is one wide banknote, a
        thin green border with wavy guilloche bands top and bottom, a 6px double
        inner frame and 2,184 in ochre in two corners. Inside are three parts.
        An engraved oval frame of six fine rings around a hatched oval holding a
        fern leaf. The denomination block with Everyday account, Balance this
        October, the large figure, the serial line MO, 31 OCT, EUR, and Held for
        Mara Okafor in italic. A guilloche rosette of two spirograph curves
        ringed by an ochre arc to 64 percent, with Japan trip above and 3,200 of
        5,000 saved and the target date below. Two mini notes follow, each with
        a spirograph medallion, Savings with Held in reserve and Credit card in
        rust with a clock. Then October series lists each category with an
        etched meter of fine horizontal green lines, spent of limit and an
        italic status, Eating out switching to vertical rust lines. Register
        lists the movements. Below 1000px the rosette drops under, below 640px
        the note stacks centred.
    spacing:
        An 8px unit. 28px between the note, mini notes and panels, 24 to 28px
        inside frames.
    density: Medium. One ornate note, two mini notes, five series lines and five register lines.
    corners: None. Ovals and rosettes are the only curves.
    borders:
        Layered. A thin engraving border, a 6px double inner frame, wavy
        guilloche bands, double rules beside headings and dotted dividers.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from fine line work.
    icons:
        Engraving as ornament, spirograph medallions and a fern in an oval
        frame. Status uses an outline circle check, ruled square or triangle
        beside italic words, and the exceeded meter turns from horizontal green
        lines to vertical rust lines.
    focus: A 2px ochre outline offset 3px with a fine green outer ring.
    tone:
        Formal issuing language, such as Balance this October, October series,
        Fully issued, Exceeded by 62 and Register.
